                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4b51048b-157e-32e6-8776-4688d671d33c",
                        "entry_id": "a4d1999b-2c5a-3ae8-9bb3-f3bc881b6fe4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "кулин. блюдо, приготовляемое из яиц взбитых с подсоленным молоком"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "52300fa7-3086-4ec2-86a1-473c869e067e",
                                "sense_id": "4b51048b-157e-32e6-8776-4688d671d33c",
                                "text": "Он приготовил вкусный омлет."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df005fbb-dbf9-3ec1-9401-ffebb4c97804",
                        "entry_id": "a4d1999b-2c5a-3ae8-9bb3-f3bc881b6fe4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "эвф. минет"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "65c51183-8c08-4630-9115-ce2fea001726",
                        "source_entry_id": "a4d1999b-2c5a-3ae8-9bb3-f3bc881b6fe4",
                        "source_sense_description": "блюдо",
                        "target_lang_word": "omelette",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "omelette",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d9cd800-7e15-3f37-9654-94a696c1ef7f",
                                        "entry_id": "66d87e51-82fd-3556-b925-a2c49c1ef5f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dish made with beaten eggs cooked in a frying pan without stirring, flipped over to cook on both sides, and sometimes filled or topped with other foodstuffs, for example cheese or chives."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22e341e4-eba0-47f4-a646-7593f92ce599",
                                                "sense_id": "0d9cd800-7e15-3f37-9654-94a696c1ef7f",
                                                "text": "He crossed to the window, which looked on to a herb garden, and seated himself on the chintz-covered window-seat and delicately watched the two, who were engaged in eating omelette and salad at a round table near the fire-place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b45ade44-b817-4f95-81fb-49be6a46d624",
                                                "sense_id": "0d9cd800-7e15-3f37-9654-94a696c1ef7f",
                                                "text": "She had never meant to confide in him — certainly not here, eating omelette and cheese sauce — but that look seemed to demand a confidence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f2dbd7c-a5c1-4853-af77-a1e429bdbcfa",
                                                "sense_id": "0d9cd800-7e15-3f37-9654-94a696c1ef7f",
                                                "text": "She stayed to lunch that day, eating omelette and peas in the kitchen, followed by treacle tart."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae5aa603-8f2f-3f89-a1f8-e77aec022739",
                                        "entry_id": "66d87e51-82fd-3556-b925-a2c49c1ef5f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A form of shellcode that searches the address space for multiple small blocks of data (\\\"eggs\\\") and recombines them into a larger block to be executed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9e55ba5-ac36-4613-9d99-b287d38db96c",
                                                "sense_id": "ae5aa603-8f2f-3f89-a1f8-e77aec022739",
                                                "text": "This approach would be altered for an optimal omelette based exploit. One would spray the heap with the omelette code solely, then load a single copy of the additional shellcode eggs into memory outside the target region for the spray."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "omelette",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1c216ab-711e-390c-afe7-6ab53eb4383c",
                                        "entry_id": "86049879-154c-32e3-a340-d168870a0e56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make into an omelette"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cb40ebd-50b6-4e12-af12-bb3f1eb0c114",
                                                "sense_id": "c1c216ab-711e-390c-afe7-6ab53eb4383c",
                                                "text": "This recipe may be adapted for scrambled eggs, i.e., instead of omeletting the eggs, simply scramble them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb0045eb-b338-4065-846e-809ff66c1595",
                                                "sense_id": "c1c216ab-711e-390c-afe7-6ab53eb4383c",
                                                "text": "'Your main concern should not be practical ethics, but to dissuade me from omeletting you.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0172e31e-4afc-474b-a8df-ca6bc90967b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "a4d1999b-2c5a-3ae8-9bb3-f3bc881b6fe4",
                        "source_sense_description": "блюдо",
                        "target_lang_word": "Omelett",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Omelett",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7aa36c76-3608-30bd-8156-ed23925359bc",
                                        "entry_id": "1faec2a3-ac24-307d-be79-d89bd24a3416",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eierkuchen, der aus verrührten Eiern, welche in der Pfanne angebraten werden, zubereitet wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12d35698-4e29-4d79-9b8a-0db05743bd67",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa36c76-3608-30bd-8156-ed23925359bc",
                                                "text": "Als wir neulich bei einem Arbeitskollegen eingeladen waren, gab es leckere Omeletts zu essen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ee7c59a-0034-4983-b0ff-f9d5bf4945a5",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa36c76-3608-30bd-8156-ed23925359bc",
                                                "text": "Dieses Rezept ergibt sieben Omelette."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f3586aa-225e-49a9-9da4-2853d0eede42",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa36c76-3608-30bd-8156-ed23925359bc",
                                                "text": "Heute essen wir Omelett."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ef50e4c-4678-4a8a-a1ef-e9db5e70c3c2",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa36c76-3608-30bd-8156-ed23925359bc",
                                                "text": "„Er hatte nicht mit ihr zum Essen gerechnet, sagte aber nichts, teilte das Omelett und legte eine Hälfte für sie auf einen Teller.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47c31f78-3d59-49be-98e5-3702be71e725",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa36c76-3608-30bd-8156-ed23925359bc",
                                                "text": "„Ich bestellte ein Omelett und eine Cola und aß, während ich im Bett lag und fernsah.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ffe6c4ac-ddbc-4d4c-9cce-018fee4ead36",
                        "source_entry_id": "a4d1999b-2c5a-3ae8-9bb3-f3bc881b6fe4",
                        "source_sense_description": "блюдо",
                        "target_lang_word": "omelette",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "omelette",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50ee28e0-ecbb-384e-b241-7622303bfe11",
                                        "entry_id": "f115684b-299a-3898-8b4e-62cbfb7a076b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mets composé d’œufs battus ensemble et cuits à la poêle souvent avec du beurre ou de l’huile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "518ccf50-3a92-414b-a468-f3b6acbda998",
                                                "sense_id": "50ee28e0-ecbb-384e-b241-7622303bfe11",
                                                "text": "La soif fut éteinte au moyen de trois ou quatre jarres d’eau, la faim apaisée par une omelette aux tomates, où il n’y avait pas trop de plumes pour une omelette espagnole."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8757a401-1984-4136-badf-1da41c53d516",
                                                "sense_id": "50ee28e0-ecbb-384e-b241-7622303bfe11",
                                                "text": "Quel beau feu de foyer pour sécher nos hardes, pendant que l’omelette sautait dans la flamme, l’inimitable omelette d’Alsace, craquante et dorée comme un gâteau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71283718-172c-454f-b42b-e7c793ff0ccf",
                                                "sense_id": "50ee28e0-ecbb-384e-b241-7622303bfe11",
                                                "text": "Mais en rentrant chez maître La Hurière, la première figure qu’aperçut notre gentilhomme fut celle de Coconnas attablé devant une gigantesque omelette au lard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3cf31e2-24b9-4641-9d17-0160402af035",
                                                "sense_id": "50ee28e0-ecbb-384e-b241-7622303bfe11",
                                                "text": "Ils étaient assis tous deux devant la petite table ronde sur laquelle Joséphine posait une omelette au rhum entourée de flammes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c329174-7b1d-4e9e-adf0-1bd716f9041a",
                                                "sense_id": "50ee28e0-ecbb-384e-b241-7622303bfe11",
                                                "text": "On leur fera une omelette et on leur donnera du « boustringue » et puis il y a du faro de première qualité et cela les apaise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9bc681f-9bd9-4dec-a561-7ec59da3f961",
                                                "sense_id": "50ee28e0-ecbb-384e-b241-7622303bfe11",
                                                "text": "– Et maintenant que j'ai parlé, j'espère qu'on ne verra plus Antoine Toquelot faire omelette avec des œufs de rossignol à l'ormeau de la Bastidone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb17c54b-e079-4a34-84e7-3e6de60935bf",
                                                "sense_id": "50ee28e0-ecbb-384e-b241-7622303bfe11",
                                                "text": "Monsieur Bilit qui a cette habitude d’arriver n’importe quel soir de la semaine à l’improviste, et s’il se trouve que c’est l’heure du dîner, on met pour lui un couvert de plus et Véra que son appétit insatiable étonne et amuse, même si le repas est assez copieux, lui fait préparer pour son dessert une énorme omelette aux confitures, son plat préféré."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
